From: George Moussalem <george.moussalem@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 08 Sep 2026 13:40:56 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] phy: qualcomm: qcom-uniphy-pcie-usb3-28lp: Remove unused of_device.h header file

